{"3926630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crapshoot", "steam_appid": 3926630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crapshoot is an emergent boss-rush boomer-shooter, where your gun is a modular slot-machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/fa4f4777942f31b676472dd8d30c0813.poster.avif?t=1775043898\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/fa4f4777942f31b676472dd8d30c0813.webm?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/fa4f4777942f31b676472dd8d30c0813.mp4?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses to earn new rollers full of powerful modifiers, build a statistically-devastating hand-cannon, give it a spin, stack the odds in your favour, and see if fate is on your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/aa3715aaae39735b12fb9c453f60e329.poster.avif?t=1775043898\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/aa3715aaae39735b12fb9c453f60e329.webm?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/aa3715aaae39735b12fb9c453f60e329.mp4?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stack The Odds, Hit The Jackpot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with a strange weapon, <i>The Rake, </i>slot machine rollers click into place, each result totally changing how the gun works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/ebc8d496fc810c3765ec85d6a9363d0d.poster.avif?t=1775043898\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/ebc8d496fc810c3765ec85d6a9363d0d.webm?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/ebc8d496fc810c3765ec85d6a9363d0d.mp4?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise it with new rollers, feed it your hard-earned chips, and spin to see what chaotic combination of effects it stacks for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/7d6c2e5f98bfdcec45fc7825a0000901.poster.avif?t=1775043898\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/7d6c2e5f98bfdcec45fc7825a0000901.webm?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/7d6c2e5f98bfdcec45fc7825a0000901.mp4?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack rollers to combine effects in unpredictable ways, build your perfect weapon and try to hit the jackpot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/a1677eafeb7bdb84d26c5a2d71c6f464.poster.avif?t=1775043898\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/a1677eafeb7bdb84d26c5a2d71c6f464.webm?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/a1677eafeb7bdb84d26c5a2d71c6f464.mp4?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/d98b5794dac215795087997cadfaaec3.poster.avif?t=1775043898\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/d98b5794dac215795087997cadfaaec3.webm?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/d98b5794dac215795087997cadfaaec3.mp4?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/1b64080f64d75bd2ef3bfe1df1b501dc.poster.avif?t=1775043898\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/1b64080f64d75bd2ef3bfe1df1b501dc.webm?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/1b64080f64d75bd2ef3bfe1df1b501dc.mp4?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playing In The Big Leagues Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face up against the biggest threats the mega-casino can throw at you, a rogues' gallery of bosses - enforcers, freaks, mutants, and mercs inhabit the upper floors where  bloodsports are televised for all to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/80d56cdc798a77955fb7bac0b76fe530.avif?t=1775043898\" width=884 height=407 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From relentless melee bruisers, backed by an eye-in-the-sky laser beam, firing surveillance system - for a punishing double boss fight, to a shapeshifting pile of chips, that can split apart to divide and conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/8082e196ac22e733957fefbbc53e76d7.poster.avif?t=1775043898\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/8082e196ac22e733957fefbbc53e76d7.webm?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/8082e196ac22e733957fefbbc53e76d7.mp4?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss has a distinct vibe, between their tactics, moves,  arena, and motivation - no two bosses will feel alike. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story So Far</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/a44bc722c696facdf5322c37664bfb01.avif?t=1775043898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras_big/a44bc722c696facdf5322c37664bfb01.avif?t=1775043898 width=1600 height=836 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a card cheat, caught red handed at a strange mega-casino that’s a law unto itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/a7960926c72bd8111985e56466c4983c.avif?t=1775043898\" width=1600 height=836 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragged off into a backroom by some well-muscled goons, to meet the mysterious owner Mr. Big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/1e2fbc74700ce529ad76791489394e0d.avif?t=1775043898\" width=830 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He gives you a choice: a long drive and short dig - or you can fight for your freedom in the megacasino’s closed-circuit bloodsport.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/d907c7fb1b20d1a05a652f2e1f466001.avif?t=1775043898\" width=1600 height=840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re given a unique weapon - the deadly offspring of a handcannon and a slotmachine - and sent on your way to fight the casino’s strongest champions - for the entertainment of all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crapshoot is an emergent boss-rush boomer-shooter, where your gun is a modular slot-machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/fa4f4777942f31b676472dd8d30c0813.poster.avif?t=1775043898\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/fa4f4777942f31b676472dd8d30c0813.webm?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/fa4f4777942f31b676472dd8d30c0813.mp4?t=1775043898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses to earn new rollers full of powerful modifiers, build a statistically-devastating hand-cannon, give it a s