etween their tactics, moves,  arena, and motivation - no two bosses will feel alike. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story So Far</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/a44bc722c696facdf5322c37664bfb01.avif?t=1775043898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras_big/a44bc722c696facdf5322c37664bfb01.avif?t=1775043898 width=1600 height=836 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a card cheat, caught red handed at a strange mega-casino that’s a law unto itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/a7960926c72bd8111985e56466c4983c.avif?t=1775043898\" width=1600 height=836 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragged off into a backroom by some well-muscled goons, to meet the mysterious owner Mr. Big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/1e2fbc74700ce529ad76791489394e0d.avif?t=1775043898\" width=830 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He gives you a choice: a long drive and short dig - or you can fight for your freedom in the megacasino’s closed-circuit bloodsport.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/extras/d907c7fb1b20d1a05a652f2e1f466001.avif?t=1775043898\" width=1600 height=840 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re given a unique weapon - the deadly offspring of a handcannon and a slotmachine - and sent on your way to fight the casino’s strongest champions - for the entertainment of all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Crapshoot is a high-stakes boss rush FPS. Arm yourself with a slot machine gun, spin for unpredictable combos, and take on surreal casino-inspired bosses. Bet your winnings to make the fights deadlier and the payouts bigger.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/fca48d68c95e5ef52ed575fac3e4cfed6b4d2fb6/header.jpg?t=1775043898", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/08e7db87b3785d2bceb7d1410094fdf9c2aeea89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775043898", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926630/08e7db87b3785d2bceb7d1410094fdf9c2aeea89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775043898", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 2200g<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GT 1030<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 6.12.17-1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 2200g<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GT 1030<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 6.12.17-1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong